stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Result
    state "切片结果" as Result
    state "已选择至少一张" as Selected
    state "不可导出：选择为空" as Empty
    state "生成分享 Intent" as Sharing
    state "写入相册" as Saving
    state "打包 ZIP" as Zipping
    state "等待旧版 Android 存储授权" as Permission
    state "外部接收 App" as Recipient
    state "完成" as Done
    state "失败／可重试" as Failed
    Result --> Selected: 勾选切片
    Result --> Empty: 取消全选
    Empty --> Selected: 重新选择
    Selected --> Sharing: 分享所选
    Selected --> Saving: 保存相册 [有权限]
    Selected --> Zipping: 打包 ZIP [有权限]
    Selected --> Permission: 系统需要授权
    Permission --> Saving: 授权并保存
    Permission --> Zipping: 授权并打包
    Permission --> Failed: 拒绝授权
    Sharing --> Recipient: 发送有序 URI 列表
    Recipient --> Done: 接收 App 自行处理顺序
    Saving --> Done: 保存成功
    Zipping --> Done: ZIP 已输出
    Saving --> Failed: 文件不可读等异常
    Zipping --> Failed: 压缩或磁盘错误
    Failed --> Selected: 重新操作
    Done --> Result: 返回切片列表
